     1	(ns yin.module
     2	  "Module system for Yin VM.
     3	
     4	  Provides a registry for libraries that can be required by client code.
     5	  Libraries export functions that may return effect descriptors, which
     6	  the VM interprets to perform side effects (store access, parking, etc.)
     7	
     8	  Usage:
     9	    ;; Register a library
    10	    (register-module! 'my.lib {'foo (fn [x] x)
    11	                               'bar (fn [] {:effect :some-effect})})
    12	
    13	    ;; In client code (compiled by Yang)
    14	    (require '[my.lib :as m])
