   272	(defn take!!
   273	  "Block until one value is available at the stream head, then return it.
   274	
   275	   Cursor-based and non-destructive: reads position 0 via (next stream ...),
   276	   polling every 10ms while the stream is open but empty (:blocked). Returns the
   277	   value on success, nil when the stream closes without a value (:end), and throws
   278	   on :daostream/gap (the position was evicted before it could be read).
   279	
