   321	From `dao.stream.implementation-plan.md`:
   322	
   323	- **Phase 1 and Phase 2, completed** — the protocols, the result convention, and
   324	  the ring buffer, including the conformance harness that Phase 1 defines and
   325	  Phase 2 first runs. If R1 depends on a completed Phase 2 then it depends on
   326	  the harness too; the earlier draft's exclusion of it was wrong.
   327	- **Phase 4a, the ws transport, both ends**, on clj and cljs.
   328	- **The cljd v2 ws transport**, which the sibling plan defers and **this plan
